#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/index.rst:5
msgid "Element cross reference"
msgstr "元件交叉引用"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"E-CAD software like QElectroTech allow creating projects where different "
"type of subsystems or/and disciplines are combined. This means that one "
"device can be represented many times."
msgstr ""
"像 QElectroTech 这样的 E-CAD 软件允许创建将不同类型的子系统或/和学科组合在一起的项目。这意味着一个设备可以被表示多次。"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"An example of combining subsystems is an electrical control system where the"
" command system and the power system are combined. The control coil from a "
"power contactor is represented at the control command system and the "
"electrical contactors are represented at the electrical power system."
msgstr ""
"组合子系统的一个例子是电气控制系统，其中指令系统与动力系统组合在一起。动力接触器的控制线圈在控制指令系统中表示，而电气接触器在电力系统中表示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"An example of combining different disciplines is the representation of an "
"hydraulic valve at the electrical schema and at the hydraulic schema."
msgstr "组合不同学科的一个例子是：在电气原理图和液压原理图中表示同一个液压阀。"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"The examples mentioned before are situations where different QElectroTech "
"elements introduced at the project are representing the same device and "
"later on they have to be listed as one item at the Bill Of Materials (BOM). "
"For this reason, QElectroTech allow defining Master and Slave elements that "
"later on will be linked. The link between master and slave elements is known"
" at QElectroTech as cross reference."
msgstr ""
"前面提到的例子都是这样的情况：项目中引入的不同 QElectroTech "
"元件表示同一设备，之后必须将它们作为一项列入物料清单（BOM）。因此，QElectroTech "
"允许定义主元件和从元件，之后再将其关联起来。主元件与从元件之间的关联在 QElectroTech 中称为交叉引用。"
